      "type": "list_item",
      "text": "Sumo: Spirit Weighs Nothing"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Erik Shirai’s beautifully shot and fascinating film grants rare access inside the disciplined inner domain of Japan’s sumo wrestling world."
