    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Look Back"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Spanning more than a decade, Hirokazu Koreeda’s tender coming-of-age story follows two girls who bond over their passion for and dream of becoming manga artists."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/godzilla-minus-zero-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Godzilla Minus Zero"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The sequel to Takashi Yamazaki’s acclaimed 2023 film is a true cinematic spectacle that’s sure to grip fans of Godzilla, as well as newcomers to the franchise."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/match-01.jpeg",
